name: Telecom fraud
tagline: "Thirteen telecom fraud typologies over synthetic CDR, subscriber-event and payment feeds - per-offender Alert Rules"
description: "A fraud content pack: three feeds (CDR, subscriber events, payments), thirteen detection windows as sql.template Jobs (IRSF, Wangiri, SIM-box, premium-rate, roaming high usage, SIM-swap, subscription / identity, dealer activations, voucher / EVD, payment reversal, recharge fraud, data-charging bypass, internal fraud), one per-entity Alert Rule per typology keyed on the offender, KPIs, a dashboard and runbooks, plus a subscriber-usage Anomaly Model (outgoing voice, SMS and data against each line's own history) whose Alert Rule is created after the model's first run - that part needs the Professional or Enterprise edition with Anomaly Detection. Every threshold is configuration. The synthetic golden corpus lands in data/samples - copy it into data/inbox/<feed> to ingest, then run the Jobs."
icon: heroicons_outline:shield-exclamation
contents[7]: "3 Pipelines + schemas", "13 detection Jobs (sql.template)", "13 per-entity Alert Rules", "Subscriber-usage Anomaly Model + pending unusual-usage Alert Rule", "KPIs", "Dashboard", "Runbooks"
